WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.460
A dim room at dusk.

2
00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:04.260
A grand piano.

3
00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:10.320
"Softly, in the dusk, a woman is singing
to me;" Then the room seems to sink,

4
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:15.280
down under the piano, into a
smaller, warmer room, years ago.

5
00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:20.690
And the listener, a grown man, finds
himself ready to "weep like a child".

6
00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:22.160
It's only a song.

7
00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:25.190
So why does it bring a grown man to tears?

8
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.490
In this mission, you'll track
where each stanza takes him,

9
00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:29.940
and how quickly.

10
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.310
You'll listen for the
sounds of the old piano,

11
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.710
heard from underneath.

12
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.300
And you'll find the words that
show him fighting the memory.

13
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:41.400
Your mission: explain why a
grown man ends up in tears.
